OL,3,GNEWSAPremature birth inspires mum to
OL,4,Awrite children's book
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has written a book to help
OL,7,Fparents explain neonatal care to their
OL,8,Fchildren after her own daughter was
OL,9,Fborn prematurely and spent the first
OL,10,Fmonth of her life in intensive care.
OL,12,FLihini Ekanayake's daughter, her first
OL,13,Fchild, was born at the Royal Derby
OL,14,FHospital eight weeks early in 2018,
OL,15,Fweighing just 3.2lbs (1.44kg).
OL,17,FA Little Too Soon is intended to help
OL,18,Fparents explain the situation to
OL,19,Fsiblings or the child themselves when
OL,20,Fthey are older, which Ekanayake, a
OL,21,Fmental health doctor at the NHS, said
OL,22,Fcould be "really confusing for them".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
